    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Hardcore survival with no hand-holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Fully customizable AR-15 with modular upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Procedurally generated desert world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Realistic scavenging &amp; crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f\u00a0Realistic vehicle physics with responsive suspension and weight handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Fully upgradeable van with engine, armor, storage customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/71c7458ee1b404f8303e024927ac7760.poster.avif?t=1754643460\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/71c7458ee1b404f8303e024927ac7760.webm?t=1754643460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/71c7458ee1b404f8303e024927ac7760.mp4?t=1754643460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qume: Echoes of Sand</strong><br>Once a vibrant and thriving world, it is now covered by an endless desert. <strong>Qume: Echoes of Sand</strong> offers an open-world experience combining survival, exploration, and combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/669458052879c596b2c81735855fd145.avif?t=1754643460\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World Transformed Into a Desert, Fight to Survive</strong><br>As you struggle to survive among dust-covered, abandoned cities and lost civilizations, everything can change at any moment. Explore vast desert landscapes, uncover ancient ruins, and gather scarce resources to determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting, Exploration, and Looting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qume</strong> features a deep crafting system. You'll need to craft weapons and equipment from the materials you gather. With every step, new tools and resources await in the ancient ruins you discover. However, there\u2019s a price to pay. Locals and other survivors won\u2019t share the same resources. Defeat enemies, loot, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Strategy</strong><br>You are not alone; waiting in the desert are enemies, other survivor groups, and wild animals. Develop your own strategies to survive, both alone and with a group. Combat will be a cornerstone of the survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Path</strong><br>Every step you take gives you a choice. Do you head towards a safe area, or risk it all in the dangerous desert for rewards? Defeat enemies, gather resources, survive, and dominate the desert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Exploration</strong><br><strong>Qume: Echoes of Sand</strong> offers a vast world to explore. Every corner holds a new experience, every lost city tells a different story. Surviving in the desert\u2019s depths will force you to unlock the secrets of a whole new world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Hardcore survival with no hand-holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Fully customizable AR-15 with modular upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Procedurally generated desert world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Realistic scavenging &amp; crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f\u00a0Realistic vehicle physics with responsive suspension and weight handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Fully upgradeable van with engine, armor, storage customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/71c7458ee1b404f8303e024927ac7760.poster.avif?t=1754643460\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/71c7458ee1b404f8303e024927ac7760.webm?t=1754643460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/71c7458ee1b404f8303e024927ac7760.mp4?t=1754643460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qume: Echoes of Sand</strong><br>Once a vibrant and thriving world, it is now covered by an endless desert. <strong>Qume: Echoes of Sand</strong> offers an open-world experience combining survival, exploration, and combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676870/extras/669458052879c596b2c81735855fd145.avif?t=1754643460\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World Transformed Into a Desert, Fight to Survive</strong><br>As you struggle to survive among dust-covered, abandoned cities and lost civilizations, everything can change at any moment. Explore vast desert landscapes, uncover ancient ruins, and gather scarce resources to determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting, Exploration, and Looting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qume</strong> features a deep crafting system. You'll need to craft weapons and equipment from the materials you gather. With every step, new tools and resources await in the ancient ruins you discover. However, there\u2019s a price to pay. Locals and other survivors won\u2019t share the same resources. Defeat enemies, loot, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Strategy</strong><br>You are not alone; waiting in the desert are enemies, other survivor groups, and wild animals. Develop your own strategies to survive, both alone and with a group. Combat will be a cornerstone of the survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Path</strong><br>Every step you take gives you a choice. Do you head towards a safe area, or risk it all in the dangerous desert for rewards? Defeat enemies, gather resources, survive, and dominate the desert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Exploration</strong><br><strong>Qume: Echoes of Sand</strong> offers a vast world to explore. Every corner holds a new experience, every lost city tells a different story. Surviving in the desert\u2019s depths will force you to unlock the secrets of a whole new world.</p>",
    "short_description": "The world has been buried in dust. For those left behind, the sand is quieter than death. Become one of the survivors in Qume and uncover the secrets hidden behind the silence.",
